<title>USA: DeRuyter CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>DeRuyter CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $4.280 million of DeRuyter Central School District, N.Y., unlimited tax school district serial bonds, 1997A, with a net interest cost of 5.2621 percent.</p>
</text>
